  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『そりゃわかるだろ……！\r\nうちで写真が趣味っていったら真っ先に思いつく』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100280020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え～？\r\nそんな簡単に容疑者にされたら三峰悲しーい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110028/4901100280020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『確定で犯人が何を……！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『……っていうか、いつ撮ったんだ？』",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100280030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "Ｐたんがめちゃめちゃ仕事に没頭してて、\r\n雑に返事しそうなタイミングで？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110028/4901100280030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100280040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "一応言っとくけど、ちゃんと許可取ったからね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110028/4901100280040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『不覚すぎる……！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100280050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうだよぉ？\r\n人の話が素通りしてっちゃうぐらい根詰めるのやめなー？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
